 "interpretation": "The mechanisms do NOT compose: cooldown alone reaches instant 0.91/0.89 (cells cd300/cd400) but adding the chase eats the gain (0.44\u20130.68): chase presses the unhit touch, plausibly shrinking the emptied-level signal cooldown keys on, while cooldown's suppressed refills shrink the depth the chase depends on (lo -0.26 at cd400+imp0.3 vs +2.95 for chase alone). No cell lands all five targets; the best (chase-only) hits 3/5. The wave-23 gap is therefore a COUPLED residual \u2014 pre-fill vacancy and post-fill chase mechanisms interfere, and a joint fit needs one mechanism that couples them (e.g. vacancy-triggered chase) rather than independent knobs.",
